<%- include('partials/head') %>
<section class="page-hero page-hero-simple"><div><span class="eyebrow">ORIGIN & PLACE</span><h1>Fruit remembers<br><em>where it grows.</em></h1><p>Fruit diversity reflects climate, long cultivation histories, wild relatives and regional food traditions. These broad origin notes are starting points—not a claim that a modern crop grows only where it first evolved.</p><a href="/families" class="button-primary">Browse by fruit group <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="simple-hero-side"><span class="big-serif-mark">🌍</span><span class="side-rule"></span><p>Origins, routes<br>and local names</p></div></section>
<section class="section-block"><div class="section-heading-row"><div><span class="eyebrow">REGIONAL OVERVIEW</span><h2>Explore origin notes</h2><p>Choose a region to meet fruit species associated with its botanical history and growing traditions.</p></div></div><div class="region-grid"><% regionRows.forEach(function(region,index) { %><article class="region-card"><div class="region-card-image"><img src="<%= region.image %>" data-wiki-page="<%= region.examples[0] ? region.examples[0].wikiTitle : 'Fruit' %>" data-image-fallback="<%= region.image %>" alt="Fruits associated with <%= region.name %>" loading="lazy"><span>REGION NOTE</span></div><div class="region-card-copy"><h3><%= region.name %></h3><p>Explore fruits associated with this broad origin and growing tradition.</p><div class="region-examples"><% region.examples.forEach(function(fruit) { %><a href="/fruit/<%= fruit.slug %>"><%= fruit.name %></a><% }); %></div><a class="text-link" href="/fruits?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(region.name) %>">Search this origin <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></article><% }); %></div></section>
<%- include('partials/end') %>
